            <div xml:id="d654">

                <pb facs="0894" n="795" sameAs="frus:frus1936v05/pg795"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.1731/156: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Lane</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-02-23T16:00:00-06:00">February 23, 1936—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>34. My telegram conversations<anchor n="21" xml:id="d654-f1"/> with Duggan this
                    afternoon. Nicaragua agreed to point number 10 and accepts article 13 as
                    drafted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lane</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
